									<section id="comp-m8vkq6rz" class="ke5pl1 comp-m8vkq6rz-container comp-m8vkq6rz wixui-section undefined fwXYgt" tabindex="-1" data-block-level-container="Section" data-testid="section-container"><div id="comp-mah05r00" class="HFEOE3 NaeT1r comp-mah05r00 wixui-box" dir="ltr" role=""><div class="comp-mah05r00-container" role="group" data-testid="responsive-container-content"><div id="comp-mah0afek" class="HFEOE3 NaeT1r comp-mah0afek-container comp-mah0afek wixui-box" dir="ltr" role=""><div id="comp-magzyraj" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL ZS_qLz PO9MfV comp-magzyraj wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text">Our philosophy at Rachana Lifestyle is all about positivity and creativity, which can be seen even in our logo, a ‘Brahma Kundalini’. This is an energy chakra that represents the source of zeal and the essence of creation. We have been experienced real estate developers serving the real estate market for more than 38 years, and have complied with the advancements in technology and design while maintaining our quality standards constantly.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id="comp-magzhray" class="ke5pl1 comp-magzhray-container comp-magzhray wixui-section undefined fwXYgt" tabindex="-1" data-block-level-container="Section" data-testid="section-container"><div id="bgLayers_comp-magzhray" class="QG9w8P" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-magzhray"> </div></section>								</div>
