					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2ff600f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="2ff600f" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">The Spirit of Creation 
</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f7841cc elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="f7841cc" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text">Driven by the Spirit of Creation, Rachana Lifestyle has been shaping Pune’s skyline with a legacy spanning over 38 years. With more than 40 iconic projects and 15,000+ happy faces, our journey is a testament to enduring quality, innovation, and trust.</p><p>Each project is more than just a structure, it’s a thoughtfully crafted experience where architecture meets functionality and comfort, designed to enrich lives and elevate everyday living.</p>								</div>
