									<h3 class="elementor-icon-box-title">
						<span  >
							Starting a company with one of my closest friends, where we could jointly explore the full potential of the real estate sector, was the best decision to date.						</span>
					</h3>
				
									<p class="elementor-icon-box-description">
						Rachana Lifestyle has grown with us. Today, we are one of the most sought-after developers, aiming to secure a prime position in the market in the years to come.<br>
When it comes to building homes, our thought process always focuses on satisfying residents. We do our best to understand their core wants and needs before planning a project.					</p>
				
