						<div class="elementor-icon-box-content">

									<h3 class="elementor-icon-box-title">
						<span  >
							As a second-generation entrepreneur, I have inherited not just a legacy, but a responsibility						</span>
					</h3>
				
									<p class="elementor-icon-box-description">
						to continue evolving with the times while holding true to our founding principles. At Rachana Lifestyle, innovation and integrity remain at the heart of everything we do. I strongly believe that the future of real estate lies in crafting experiences, not just buildings. We are committed to delivering thoughtful spaces that resonate with the modern lifestyle and aspirations of our customers.					</p>
				
