									<h3 class="elementor-icon-box-title">
						<span  >
							Growing up in an environment where business values and customer-centric thinking were part of daily life has shaped my vision as a real estate developer.						</span>
					</h3>
				
									<p class="elementor-icon-box-description">
						At Rachana Lifestyle, we are focused on refining the customer journey, from discovery to delivery. With every new project, we aim to push the envelope on quality, design, and trust. Our mission is to be more than just builders, we strive to be creators of community, comfort, and lasting value.					</p>
				
