					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Core Pillars</h2>				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3bc87ce e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="3bc87ce" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3523590 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child" data-id="3523590" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-91d41bf elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box" data-id="91d41bf" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image-box.default">
					<div class="elementor-image-box-wrapper"><figure class="elementor-image-box-img"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="109" height="100" src="https://rachanalifestyle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Imagination.svg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-539" alt="" /></figure><div class="elementor-image-box-content"><h3 class="elementor-image-box-title">Imagination</h3><p class="elementor-image-box-description">Every masterpiece begins with a vision. We imagine spaces that do more than function  they move, inspire, and evolve with the people who live and work within them.
</p></div></div>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-dd8c2f0 elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box" data-id="dd8c2f0" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image-box.default">
					<div class="elementor-image-box-wrapper"><figure class="elementor-image-box-img"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="100" height="100" src="https://rachanalifestyle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Precision.svg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-541" alt="" /></figure><div class="elementor-image-box-content"><h3 class="elementor-image-box-title">Precision</h3><p class="elementor-image-box-description">In real estate, precision is everything. From foundation to finish, we obsess over the smallest details to ensure every line, layout, and material meets our uncompromising standards.

</p></div></div>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6bc9643 elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box" data-id="6bc9643" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image-box.default">
					<div class="elementor-image-box-wrapper"><figure class="elementor-image-box-img"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="50" height="100" src="https://rachanalifestyle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Innovation.svg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-540" alt="" /></figure><div class="elementor-image-box-content"><h3 class="elementor-image-box-title">Innovation</h3><p class="elementor-image-box-description">Design is nothing without progress. We integrate smart technology, sustainable systems, and modern aesthetics to create future-ready spaces with timeless appeal.</p></div></div>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c7a1387 elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box" data-id="c7a1387" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image-box.default">
					<div class="elementor-image-box-wrapper"><figure class="elementor-image-box-img"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="101" height="100" src="https://rachanalifestyle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/craftmanship.svg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-542" alt="" /></figure><div class="elementor-image-box-content"><h3 class="elementor-image-box-title">Craftsmanship</h3><p class="elementor-image-box-description">True luxury lives in the details. Our teams carry decades of skill, heart, and discipline into every curve, edge, and corner, so you can feel the difference, not just see it.</p></div></div>				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c111ba9 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="c111ba9" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-094bbb9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="094bbb9" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Sustainability</h2>				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1e648d9 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="1e648d9" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8bef6ae e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child" data-id="8bef6ae" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ff69baf elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="ff69baf" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<section id="comp-mao5gixo" class="ke5pl1 comp-mao5gixo wixui-section fwXYgt" tabindex="-1" data-block-level-container="Section" data-testid="section-container"><div class="comp-mao5gixo-container max-width-container" role="group" data-testid="responsive-container-content"><div id="comp-mayua4qq" class="HFEOE3 NaeT1r comp-mayua4qq-container comp-mayua4qq wixui-box" dir="ltr" role=""><div id="comp-mavaetmj" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL ZS_qLz PO9MfV comp-mavaetmj wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text">At Rachana Lifestyle, we believe that building beautifully also means building responsibly. With over 38 years of experience, we design homes and spaces that not only inspire but also care for the world around us.</p><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text">Every project is a promise, to use smarter materials, adopt greener practices, and continually evolve how we build. Because sustainability isn’t just about the planet. It’s about creating a better way of living for everyone, now and for generations to come.</p></div></div></div></section>								</div>
